      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I encountered the issue tonight and three other user were able to repro.\n\nActual Result:\n\nRotating the head affect the slider value while adjusting sliders with the laser pointer in VR.\n\nExpected Result:\n\nThe slider value should only be affected by the laser pointer attached to the user hand.\n\nSTR:\n\n1. Open the quick or big menu\n\n2. Navigate to a menu containing sliders\n\n3. Press and maintain trigger on a slider to edit the value\n\n4. Rotate the head/ HMD while maintaining the slider\n\n5. Observe how the slider value changed despite that the controller remained stable.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
